WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.933 --> 00:00:05.233
Our heroes are continuing their journey through the Kalos region.

2
00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:08.299
After witnessing a riveting battle between Grant and Viola

3
00:00:08.366 --> 00:00:12.899
at the Battle Chateau and finding out Grant is the Cyllage City Gym Leader,

4
00:00:12.966 --> 00:00:15.500
Ash knows he has his work cut out for him.

5
00:00:15.566 --> 00:00:18.266
All right! Froakie, Water Pulse!

6
00:00:18.333 --> 00:00:19.866
Froakie!

7
00:00:23.666 --> 00:00:25.633
Fletch!

8
00:00:25.700 --> 00:00:27.500
Ling! Fletchling!

9
00:00:27.566 --> 00:00:31.233
Wow, Fletchling, your Double Team timing was perfect!

10
00:00:31.299 --> 00:00:33.000
Okay Froakie, use Bubble!

11
00:00:33.066 --> 00:00:36.166
Froakie!

12
00:00:36.233 --> 00:00:39.366
Fletch! Fletch! Fletch! Fletchling!

13
00:00:39.433 --> 00:00:42.699
Fletch! Fletchling! Fletch!

14
00:00:44.166 --> 00:00:46.199
Yeah. Just like that!

15
00:00:46.266 --> 00:00:47.833
- Froak.
- Fletchling!

16
00:00:47.900 --> 00:00:50.599
- You were great too, Fletchling.
- Fletchling.

17
00:00:50.666 --> 00:00:52.400
- Huh?

18
00:00:52.466 --> 00:00:54.699
Those Pokémon are sure looking good.

19
00:00:54.766 --> 00:00:58.900
- Alexa!
- Good to see you! It's been a while.

20
00:00:58.966 --> 00:01:01.866
♪ I want to be the very best ♪

21
00:01:01.933 --> 00:01:04.566
♪ Like no one ever was ♪

22
00:01:04.633 --> 00:01:08.100
♪ To catch them is my real test ♪

23
00:01:08.166 --> 00:01:11.266
♪ To train them is my cause ♪

24
00:01:11.333 --> 00:01:14.333
♪ Pokémon! Got to catch them all It's you and me ♪

25
00:01:14.399 --> 00:01:17.533
♪ Pokémon! I know it's my destiny ♪

26
00:01:17.600 --> 00:01:20.966
♪ Pokémon! Yeah, you're my best friend ♪

27
00:01:21.033 --> 00:01:23.666
♪ In a world we must defend ♪

28
00:01:23.733 --> 00:01:25.899
♪ Pokémon! Got to catch them all ♪

29
00:01:25.966 --> 00:01:28.966
♪ Got to catch them all! Pokémon! ♪

30
00:01:38.033 --> 00:01:40.533
- You all look well!
- Thanks!

31
00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:44.033
So, you decided to travel along with Ash as well, I see.

32
00:01:44.100 --> 00:01:47.766
Right and so much has happened since I made that choice.

33
00:01:47.833 --> 00:01:50.133
I can imagine!

34
00:01:50.199 --> 00:01:52.500
-Pika!

35
00:01:52.566 --> 00:01:55.033
Na-na-na.

36
00:01:55.100 --> 00:01:58.666
- Na-na-na!
- Pika.

37
00:02:02.266 --> 00:02:04.733
So, Alexa, what brings you here anyway?

38
00:02:04.800 --> 00:02:06.899
You saw Viola at the Battle Chateau.

39
00:02:06.966 --> 00:02:08.799
- Right?
- Huh? Yeah.

40
00:02:10.133 --> 00:02:14.433
Everyone knows how strong Viola is, but she still lost to Grant.

41
00:02:15.433 --> 00:02:20.366
That wasn't easy for her. Poor dear! She does not like losing one bit.

42
00:02:20.433 --> 00:02:22.733
Then Viola told me that your next stop

43
00:02:22.799 --> 00:02:25.366
was going to be the Cyllage City Gym.

44
00:02:25.433 --> 00:02:27.466
I needed to come this way to do some research

45
00:02:27.533 --> 00:02:31.066
for an article I've been working on and I was hoping to bump into you,

46
00:02:31.133 --> 00:02:33.866
and so voilà! Here I am!

47
00:02:33.933 --> 00:02:37.500
- What kind of article?
- I'm writing about the Fossil Lab.

48
00:02:37.566 --> 00:02:39.266
So what's the Fossil Lab?

49
00:02:39.333 --> 00:02:42.966
The Fossil Lab in Ambrette Town is a very famous facility!

50
00:02:43.033 --> 00:02:45.500
What kind of place is a fossil lab, anyway?

51
00:02:45.566 --> 00:02:47.233
It's a place where researchers study

52
00:02:47.299 --> 00:02:49.833
the fossils of Pokémon from ancient times.

53
00:02:49.900 --> 00:02:54.433
Their goal is to learn as much as they can about how Pokémon lived then.

54
00:02:54.500 --> 00:02:56.000
That sounds complicated.

55
00:02:56.066 --> 00:02:59.000
Recently, the researchers made a big discovery

56
00:02:59.066 --> 00:03:01.799
and that's what I'm writing my article about.

57
00:03:01.866 --> 00:03:04.733
Big discovery? I wonder what it is!

58
00:03:04.799 --> 00:03:06.933
Pika?

59
00:03:07.000 --> 00:03:10.100
I know! Why not come with me if you like!

60
00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:13.233
- You'll be astounded!
- Hel!

61
00:03:13.299 --> 00:03:16.500
- That'd be great!
- Going there would be such a treat!

62
00:03:16.566 --> 00:03:17.766
Pika!

63
00:03:17.833 --> 00:03:22.733
But aren't fossils like bones and rocks and stuff? I don't think I get the appeal.

64
00:03:22.799 --> 00:03:24.733
You can't be serious, can you?

65
00:03:24.799 --> 00:03:27.366
Don't you see? Fossils are filled with fun!

66
00:03:27.433 --> 00:03:30.866
- Not to mention science!
- Oh. Great!

67
00:03:30.933 --> 00:03:34.433
Welcome to the Fossil Lab, everyone. My name is Thaddeus

68
00:03:34.500 --> 00:03:36.133
and I'm a researcher here.

69
00:03:36.200 --> 00:03:39.866
I'm Alexa and I'm writing the article. It's a pleasure to meet you.

70
00:03:39.933 --> 00:03:43.299
- It's a pleasure to meet you.
- The pleasure's mine.

71
00:03:43.366 --> 00:03:45.666
Right this way, please!

72
00:03:48.833 --> 00:03:53.166
Well, well. Fossil Lab. That discovery talk sounds interesting.

73
00:03:53.233 --> 00:03:56.533
If it happens to be a big discovery concerning Pokémon.

74
00:03:56.600 --> 00:04:00.533
Of course! Then it'll help us put Team Rocket on top of the heap!

75
00:04:00.600 --> 00:04:02.666
Let's spy on them.

76
00:04:13.233 --> 00:04:20.033
Wow! Look at that! These are all fossils of Pokémon from ancient times!

77
00:04:20.099 --> 00:04:23.966
So awesome! I can't believe they found so many fossils!

78
00:04:24.033 --> 00:04:25.400
Pikachu!

79
00:04:27.133 --> 00:04:29.333
Look! Those sure are huge bones.

80
00:04:29.400 --> 00:04:31.400
- Aren't they, Dedenne?
- Nenne!

81
00:04:32.633 --> 00:04:35.400
Hm. They just look like regular rocks to me.

82
00:04:35.466 --> 00:04:37.466
What's so great about them?

83
00:04:39.233 --> 00:04:41.833
Is the big discovery one of the things in here?

84
00:04:41.900 --> 00:04:43.566
No, it's even more amazing.

85
00:04:43.633 --> 00:04:46.233
Just wait and see!

86
00:04:46.300 --> 00:04:47.433
- Huh?
- Pika?

87
00:04:49.300 --> 00:04:52.433
Now, before I take you into the next room,

88
00:04:52.500 --> 00:04:54.666
please put on this cold weather gear.

89
00:04:54.733 --> 00:04:57.700
- Huh? Cold weather gear?
- Pikachu?

90
00:05:03.066 --> 00:05:06.099
Cold!

91
00:05:06.166 --> 00:05:08.566
What is this place?

92
00:05:08.633 --> 00:05:11.099
It's like a gigantic freezer in here!

93
00:05:11.166 --> 00:05:15.333
Freezer? Dedenne, are you okay?

94
00:05:15.400 --> 00:05:20.200
Sorry. We've set the room temperature for the comfort of the Pokémon in here.

95
00:05:21.599 --> 00:05:25.099
-Pika! Pika!

96
00:05:28.133 --> 00:05:30.300
- Pika? Pikachu!
- Huh?

97
00:05:30.366 --> 00:05:32.033
- Cold!

98
00:05:32.099 --> 00:05:34.533
- What's that?
- Pika?

99
00:05:34.599 --> 00:05:37.966
- Ma!
- Who's that Pokémon?

100
00:05:38.033 --> 00:05:39.966
- Pika?
- Wow, an Amaura!

101
00:05:40.033 --> 00:05:42.966
It's a Pokémon from long ago believed to have lived

102
00:05:43.033 --> 00:05:46.733
in a frozen area of the Kalos region, way, way up north!

103
00:05:46.800 --> 00:05:51.200
You're quite well informed. Yes, it's an Amaura.

104
00:05:51.266 --> 00:05:54.766
These Pokémon have been extinct since long, long ago.

105
00:05:54.833 --> 00:05:58.333
-Huh? What's that?!

106
00:05:59.366 --> 00:06:01.866
Ama?

107
00:06:04.466 --> 00:06:07.866
And this is Amaura's evolved form, Aurorus.

108
00:06:07.933 --> 00:06:10.466
It's huge!

109
00:06:10.533 --> 00:06:13.533
Amaura and Aurorus? They're alive!

110
00:06:13.599 --> 00:06:18.000
This must be the big discovery! Not fossils, but real, living Pokémon!

111
00:06:18.066 --> 00:06:21.433
That's right. I wanted to do some reporting on them.

112
00:06:22.633 --> 00:06:25.400
Our fossil lab sent out an excavating group

113
00:06:25.466 --> 00:06:28.833
that discovered something in a glacier far to the north.

114
00:06:34.500 --> 00:06:36.433
Oh!

115
00:06:37.400 --> 00:06:41.166
And what we restored from that frozen Sail Fossil is

116
00:06:41.233 --> 00:06:43.533
what you now see in front of you!

117
00:06:44.733 --> 00:06:47.666
Incredible! Being able to see

118
00:06:47.733 --> 00:06:50.866
a living Amaura and Aurorus with my very own eyes!

119
00:06:52.400 --> 00:06:54.266
Huh?

120
00:06:54.333 --> 00:06:57.833
- Do you want to play, Amaura?
- Ma!

121
00:06:57.900 --> 00:07:00.133
Me, too! Me, too!

122
00:07:00.200 --> 00:07:04.066
You see, they lived in an area with very few enemies

123
00:07:04.133 --> 00:07:08.066
and, as a result, they're very trusting and friendly.

124
00:07:08.133 --> 00:07:11.266
- Yeah, I can tell!

125
00:07:11.333 --> 00:07:14.200
Of course you couldn't have known that just by looking at a fossil!

126
00:07:14.266 --> 00:07:18.266
Right and because we're able to observe them like this,

127
00:07:18.333 --> 00:07:21.099
we may learn a lot more about other ancient Pokémon!

128
00:07:21.166 --> 00:07:24.200
- I want a hug too!
- Amaura!

129
00:07:25.366 --> 00:07:27.900
Aw. So cute!

130
00:07:27.966 --> 00:07:29.900
May I get a hug as well?

131
00:07:29.966 --> 00:07:32.133
Ma!

132
00:07:32.200 --> 00:07:34.900
This is absolutely incredible!

133
00:07:34.966 --> 00:07:37.099
Thaddeus, can you tell us some of the things

134
00:07:37.166 --> 00:07:39.700
you've learned so far from this discovery?

135
00:07:39.766 --> 00:07:41.500
I'd be happy to!

136
00:07:46.266 --> 00:07:49.099
A restored ancient Pokémon, eh?

137
00:07:49.166 --> 00:07:51.700
Now, that would be handy to have on hand!

138
00:07:51.766 --> 00:07:55.700
Here's the deal! Amaura and Aurorus, we'll steal them both!

139
00:08:01.599 --> 00:08:05.033
I feel frozen, it's so cold!

140
00:08:05.099 --> 00:08:07.700
Huh? Really? Well, not me!

141
00:08:07.766 --> 00:08:10.233
- I feel warm as toast!
- Pika!

142
00:08:10.299 --> 00:08:12.599
Of course, he's been running like crazy.

143
00:08:12.666 --> 00:08:14.766
I'm not surprised you're cold.

144
00:08:14.833 --> 00:08:17.833
- We've been in here for a while.
- Hel!

145
00:08:17.900 --> 00:08:20.266
Let's head out and warm up, okay?

146
00:08:20.333 --> 00:08:23.266
Aw. But I still want to play with Amaura!

147
00:08:23.333 --> 00:08:26.266
- Nenne!
- You've got to think about Dedenne.

148
00:08:26.333 --> 00:08:29.466
We have to make sure it doesn't catch a cold.

149
00:08:29.533 --> 00:08:34.900
Hmm. Amaura, we've got to go, but we'll be back!

150
00:08:34.966 --> 00:08:37.000
Ama! Ama!

151
00:08:37.066 --> 00:08:41.766
- Sorry!
- Maura...

152
00:08:43.166 --> 00:08:46.800
The twerps have flown the coop!

153
00:08:48.666 --> 00:08:51.800
- The doors to success!
- Open them!

154
00:08:56.033 --> 00:08:59.066
Who's that Pokémon?

155
00:09:03.100 --> 00:09:05.266
It's Amaura!

156
00:09:14.666 --> 00:09:18.366
- My whiskers froze!
- Whatever. Let's keep moving!

157
00:09:18.433 --> 00:09:22.100
Amaura, where are you? Hm? Hm?

158
00:09:22.166 --> 00:09:25.033
Huh? There you are!

159
00:09:25.100 --> 00:09:30.033
Amaura, darling! It's no fun playing by yourself, is it?

160
00:09:30.100 --> 00:09:33.800
-I'll be your new playmate!

161
00:09:33.866 --> 00:09:37.300
- Over here!
- Can't catch me! Come and see!

162
00:09:39.266 --> 00:09:41.100
Here!

163
00:09:41.166 --> 00:09:42.699
Badabing!

164
00:09:44.533 --> 00:09:46.833
- Ka-ching!
- Huh?

165
00:09:46.900 --> 00:09:51.166
- Hold on. We need Aurorus, too!
- We've got work to do! Where is it?

166
00:09:51.233 --> 00:09:54.066
Aurorus? Hm? Hm? Huh? There!

167
00:09:57.633 --> 00:10:00.233
- Rrr!
- Chill, it's cool!

168
00:10:00.300 --> 00:10:03.566
We'll take you to a place where life is beautiful all the time!

169
00:10:03.633 --> 00:10:07.433
You come along with us and we'll play and play and play and play and play!

170
00:10:07.500 --> 00:10:09.933
- Rrr?
- You can trust us.

171
00:10:10.000 --> 00:10:12.433
- Look in these honest eyes!
- No lies!

172
00:10:12.500 --> 00:10:14.300
Rrrr.

173
00:10:14.366 --> 00:10:17.666
Be a good Pokémon and put one foot in front of the other!

174
00:10:17.733 --> 00:10:21.100
- Pretty please?
- Can we wrap it up in this century?

175
00:10:21.166 --> 00:10:23.699
I'd like nothing more than to move while I'm still young!

176
00:10:23.766 --> 00:10:27.933
But this big brute won't budge!

177
00:10:28.000 --> 00:10:30.433
Rrr? Rrr!

178
00:10:30.500 --> 00:10:32.500
Keep it down! If you don't cease and desist,

179
00:10:32.566 --> 00:10:34.733
you'll attract the wrong element!

180
00:10:34.800 --> 00:10:37.333
- Huh? Aurorus?
- Hey, who are you?

181
00:10:37.400 --> 00:10:40.633
- Ah! The jig is up! Run!
- Run!

182
00:10:40.699 --> 00:10:44.466
Oh well. We've got Amaura. Let's get out of here!

183
00:10:44.533 --> 00:10:46.699
Ten four!

184
00:10:46.766 --> 00:10:48.300
Stop! Who are you?

185
00:10:51.366 --> 00:10:56.433
- Calm down!
- You've got to stay right here!

186
00:10:56.500 --> 00:10:58.033
What's going on?

187
00:10:58.100 --> 00:11:02.866
Oh, it's terrible! Some strange people just carried off Amaura in a truck!

188
00:11:02.933 --> 00:11:04.233
They did? No!

189
00:11:04.300 --> 00:11:05.500
- Pika?
- Amaura!

190
00:11:05.566 --> 00:11:09.366
Oh, no! We've got to recover Amaura right away, or else!

191
00:11:09.433 --> 00:11:11.466
What do you mean, or else?

192
00:11:11.533 --> 00:11:13.833
Amaura can't handle warm temperatures.

193
00:11:13.900 --> 00:11:16.900
For a short time, it can help keep its body temperature down

194
00:11:16.966 --> 00:11:21.699
by producing its own cold air, but if Amaura's in a warm place for too long...

195
00:11:21.766 --> 00:11:23.633
If that happens, then what?

196
00:11:23.699 --> 00:11:26.133
Amaura will keep on getting weaker.

197
00:11:26.199 --> 00:11:28.500
It's in big trouble!

198
00:11:28.566 --> 00:11:31.033
We've got to save it! We've got to!

199
00:11:31.100 --> 00:11:34.133
Huh. But we have no idea which way they went.

200
00:11:36.333 --> 00:11:39.666
- Ma!
- Rrr!

201
00:11:39.733 --> 00:11:43.699
- Rrr!
- Don't go! Please!

202
00:11:43.766 --> 00:11:48.833
Aurorus, what's wrong?

203
00:11:48.900 --> 00:11:51.733
- What's that?
- An aurora?

204
00:11:51.800 --> 00:11:53.900
- Amaura's creating that.
- Huh?

205
00:11:53.966 --> 00:11:56.900
When Amaura cries, it affects the magnetic waves

206
00:11:56.966 --> 00:11:59.566
in the upper atmosphere and an aurora appears.

207
00:11:59.633 --> 00:12:04.333
So, that means Amaura is somewhere over in the direction of that aurora, correct?

208
00:12:04.400 --> 00:12:06.333
Correct. Aurorus!

209
00:12:06.400 --> 00:12:08.566
Aurorus knows Amaura needs help!

210
00:12:08.633 --> 00:12:10.400
But it's too dangerous!

211
00:12:10.466 --> 00:12:14.433
We'll go with Aurorus, too! We've got to do something, quick!

212
00:12:14.500 --> 00:12:16.666
- We've got to save Amaura!
- Right!

213
00:12:16.733 --> 00:12:18.233
- Right!
- Okay!

214
00:12:18.300 --> 00:12:21.900
- He's right. Let's go along with Aurorus!
- Hurr!

215
00:12:21.966 --> 00:12:25.466
When we find Amaura, we'll need help to bring them back!

216
00:12:25.533 --> 00:12:27.166
- So, be ready!
- Will do.

217
00:12:31.733 --> 00:12:34.666
We've got Amaura and we're feeling fine!

218
00:12:34.733 --> 00:12:38.666
Once we put this ancient Pokémon safely in the Boss's hands,

219
00:12:38.733 --> 00:12:41.566
we'll certainly be on his A-list!

220
00:12:41.633 --> 00:12:44.666
-Cover your mouth!

221
00:12:44.733 --> 00:12:49.666
It's kind of chilly in here. It is now that you mention it.

222
00:12:49.733 --> 00:12:51.099
Oh, grow up!

223
00:12:53.199 --> 00:12:54.666
Toasty!

224
00:12:57.699 --> 00:12:59.666
Ama?

225
00:13:13.733 --> 00:13:16.266
- Aurorus, what's up?
- Pika?

226
00:13:16.333 --> 00:13:19.000
What's happening to the aurora?

227
00:13:19.066 --> 00:13:22.199
- It's disappearing!
- What does that mean?

228
00:13:22.266 --> 00:13:26.566
Since the aurora is produced from Amaura's cries, it can't mean anything good.

229
00:13:26.633 --> 00:13:29.866
Without the cold, something bad might be happening.

230
00:13:32.166 --> 00:13:35.400
Don't worry, Aurorus! We'll get Amaura back safely!

231
00:13:35.466 --> 00:13:37.599
- No doubt!
- Pikachu.

232
00:13:41.000 --> 00:13:43.699
Hey! Something's screwy.

233
00:13:43.766 --> 00:13:45.533
Equipment problems.

234
00:13:45.599 --> 00:13:48.466
- Like what?
- Let's take a look.

235
00:13:51.033 --> 00:13:54.400
- Ah, we got a flat.
- So we change it.

236
00:13:54.466 --> 00:13:55.966
Right. Chop, chop!

237
00:13:59.900 --> 00:14:03.633
- The road stops here.
- But which way did the truck go?

238
00:14:04.599 --> 00:14:07.033
We've got to find Amaura.

239
00:14:07.099 --> 00:14:08.933
- Rrr!
- Aurorus!

240
00:14:09.000 --> 00:14:13.266
What is it?

241
00:14:16.333 --> 00:14:20.099
Rrr!

242
00:14:20.166 --> 00:14:23.266
It's calling out to Amaura.

243
00:14:23.333 --> 00:14:26.133
I wonder if Amaura hears Aurorus.

244
00:14:27.300 --> 00:14:29.766
We can only hope that it's loud enough.

245
00:14:29.833 --> 00:14:32.800
- It has to be!
- Amaura!

246
00:14:32.866 --> 00:14:34.199
Pika! Pika!

247
00:14:34.266 --> 00:14:36.833
Rrr!

248
00:14:36.900 --> 00:14:38.233
Ma?

249
00:14:38.300 --> 00:14:40.133
Rrr!

250
00:14:40.199 --> 00:14:43.066
- Amaura, please answer!
- Pikachu!

251
00:14:43.133 --> 00:14:46.266
Rrr!

252
00:14:46.333 --> 00:14:48.133
Ah!

253
00:14:49.266 --> 00:14:52.266
Maura!

254
00:14:55.133 --> 00:14:58.633
- Rrr!
- Look, the aurora is back!

255
00:14:58.699 --> 00:15:01.800
- Amaura must have heard your voice!
- Rrr.

256
00:15:01.866 --> 00:15:03.599
But it's across the river.

257
00:15:03.666 --> 00:15:07.866
Rrr!

258
00:15:07.933 --> 00:15:13.333
- Aurorus froze the whole river!
- Way to go, Aurorus!

259
00:15:20.366 --> 00:15:22.300
The aurora's fading!

260
00:15:22.366 --> 00:15:25.300
Yeah, but Amaura's got to be close by!

261
00:15:29.366 --> 00:15:33.300
All right, you've got to be the ones who stole Amaura! Who are you?

262
00:15:33.366 --> 00:15:35.833
Prepare for trouble, you know us well!

263
00:15:35.900 --> 00:15:38.300
With our style, you should have been able to tell.

264
00:15:38.366 --> 00:15:40.800
To protect the world from devastation!

265
00:15:40.866 --> 00:15:43.766
To unite all people within our nation!

266
00:15:43.833 --> 00:15:46.566
To denounce the evils of truth and love!

267
00:15:46.633 --> 00:15:49.300
To extend our reach to the stars above!

268
00:15:50.199 --> 00:15:51.866
- Jessie!
- And James.

269
00:15:51.933 --> 00:15:55.066
Team Rocket blasts off at the speed of light!

270
00:15:55.133 --> 00:15:58.333
Surrender now or prepare for a well-researched fight!

271
00:15:58.400 --> 00:16:01.599
- Meowth, that's right!
- Wobbuffet!

272
00:16:03.166 --> 00:16:06.633
Team Rocket! I should've known you'd do something like this!

273
00:16:06.699 --> 00:16:09.699
- Give us back Amaura!
- Dream on, twerpette.

274
00:16:09.766 --> 00:16:12.733
Amaura's a very precious, restored ancient Pokémon.

275
00:16:12.800 --> 00:16:14.633
One that will be put to good use!

276
00:16:14.699 --> 00:16:16.866
- I won't let you!
- Pika!

277
00:16:16.933 --> 00:16:19.400
Then let's see what you've got, young twerp!

278
00:16:19.466 --> 00:16:22.133
- Wob!
- Ash, we've got to hurry!

279
00:16:22.199 --> 00:16:24.733
- Let's do this fast!
- Only in your dreams!

280
00:16:24.800 --> 00:16:27.266
All right, Chespin, let's go!

281
00:16:28.266 --> 00:16:30.733
- Che!
- Okay. Inkay, out!

282
00:16:32.699 --> 00:16:34.900
- Inkay!
- Use Pin Missile!

283
00:16:34.966 --> 00:16:37.400
Chespin!

284
00:16:37.466 --> 00:16:39.900
Huh?

285
00:16:41.866 --> 00:16:45.533
- Quietly.
- Hm! Oh, no you don't.

286
00:16:45.599 --> 00:16:49.366
Out of our way! We don't have the time! Fennekin, let's go!

287
00:16:50.666 --> 00:16:53.500
- Fenn!
- All right, Hidden Power!

288
00:16:53.566 --> 00:16:55.933
Fennekin!

289
00:16:56.000 --> 00:17:01.000
You and your fur ball are out of luck!

290
00:17:01.066 --> 00:17:04.200
-Fenn!

291
00:17:04.266 --> 00:17:06.333
Give it up! Huh?

292
00:17:06.399 --> 00:17:08.833
Aurorus?

293
00:17:13.399 --> 00:17:16.099
Oh! Amaura! Ash, it's in here!

294
00:17:16.166 --> 00:17:18.133
Hurry, before it's too late!

295
00:17:18.200 --> 00:17:21.200
- Let's go, Pikachu!
- Pikachu!

296
00:17:21.266 --> 00:17:24.266
- Use Thunderbolt!
- Pika...

297
00:17:24.333 --> 00:17:26.266
Wobbuffet, and action!

298
00:17:26.333 --> 00:17:28.700
Chu!

299
00:17:28.766 --> 00:17:30.866
Wobbuffet!

300
00:17:30.933 --> 00:17:32.566
Pika!

301
00:17:35.033 --> 00:17:36.700
Aurorus!

302
00:17:36.766 --> 00:17:39.200
- Now it moves!
- Wo!

303
00:17:43.266 --> 00:17:46.066
I need a blankie.

304
00:17:46.133 --> 00:17:49.266
- Thank you, Aurorus!
- Aurorus.

305
00:17:49.333 --> 00:17:52.066
All right, Pikachu! Thunderbolt, let's go!

306
00:17:52.133 --> 00:17:56.566
Pika! Pikachu!

307
00:17:56.633 --> 00:17:58.366
We're blasting off again!

308
00:17:58.433 --> 00:18:01.633
- Flash-frozen to boot!
- Wobbuffet!

309
00:18:01.700 --> 00:18:03.133
Inkay!

310
00:18:04.300 --> 00:18:09.133
Hang in there, Amaura.

311
00:18:09.200 --> 00:18:12.566
Oh! Amaura's temperature has gotten much too high!

312
00:18:12.633 --> 00:18:14.633
Amaura!

313
00:18:14.700 --> 00:18:18.466
- Please, hang in there!
- Pika! Pika!

314
00:18:20.300 --> 00:18:22.600
-Amaura!

315
00:18:22.666 --> 00:18:25.133
We've got to get it back to the lab now!

316
00:18:27.066 --> 00:18:28.700
- Huh?

317
00:18:28.766 --> 00:18:33.166
- Aurorus!
- What's it going to do?

318
00:18:40.733 --> 00:18:45.133
I see! Aurorus is chilling the air to help Amaura cool down!

319
00:18:51.033 --> 00:18:52.533
Ma!

320
00:18:52.600 --> 00:18:55.733
Thank goodness! Amaura looks a whole lot better now!

321
00:18:55.800 --> 00:18:57.833
That was great, Aurorus!

322
00:18:59.899 --> 00:19:01.033
Maura!

323
00:19:01.100 --> 00:19:04.000
Now, let's hurry and get back to the fossil lab.

324
00:19:04.066 --> 00:19:06.033
- Huh?

325
00:19:06.100 --> 00:19:09.533
Look, the truck! Over here!

326
00:19:09.600 --> 00:19:14.766
There they are! You're going to be just fine, Amaura.

327
00:19:20.166 --> 00:19:22.933
Are you back to feeling great, Amaura?

328
00:19:23.000 --> 00:19:25.000
- Pika?
- Ma!

329
00:19:25.066 --> 00:19:27.899
Amaura's body temperature is back to normal.

330
00:19:27.966 --> 00:19:31.933
- And we're so glad!
- Wow, that's great, right, buddy?

331
00:19:32.000 --> 00:19:32.966
Pikachu!

332
00:19:33.033 --> 00:19:35.300
- You're all better! Yay!
- Na-na!

333
00:19:35.366 --> 00:19:38.800
- Sorry it's been rough.
- Ma!

334
00:19:38.866 --> 00:19:41.200
- Ma!
- Aurorus!

335
00:19:43.866 --> 00:19:46.333
- They look so happy!
- Pika!

336
00:19:46.399 --> 00:19:48.800
- Pika.
- Huh? Hey! You're freezing!

337
00:19:48.866 --> 00:19:52.666
Wow, Ash. You're so lucky. I really want to get nuzzled, too!

338
00:19:52.733 --> 00:19:55.800
- Hey, that's cold!

339
00:19:55.866 --> 00:20:00.300
- Me, too! Oh, that is cold! Love it!
- Ma!

340
00:20:00.366 --> 00:20:02.666
Say, mind if I join in?

341
00:20:04.733 --> 00:20:07.600
I think it's the perfect time for a snowball fight!

342
00:20:07.666 --> 00:20:08.899
- Na-na!
- All right!

343
00:20:19.333 --> 00:20:22.466
And so, just as it might have been in ancient times,

344
00:20:22.533 --> 00:20:26.466
it's beautiful to see people and Pokémon having fun together.

345
00:20:26.533 --> 00:20:29.466
Ha-ha! This should be a great article!

346
00:20:29.533 --> 00:20:32.899
Thanks to the bond between the restored ancient Pokémon

347
00:20:32.966 --> 00:20:36.533
Amaura and Aurorus, both are safely back at the Fossil Lab,

348
00:20:36.600 --> 00:20:39.300
which is cause for celebration by everyone.

349
00:20:39.366 --> 00:20:44.533
It's another memorable adventure, as our heroes' journey continues!
